    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d96">

                <pb facs="0102" n="96" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg96"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 97.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-01-18"><hi rendition="#italic">January 18, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received March 7.)</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The general Wei Ju-kuei was executed
                    yesterday. He commanded the Sheng corps, which was composed of the best of the
                    troops of Li Hung-chang. I inclose a translation of the imperial decree
                    sentencing him to decapitation.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Denby.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d96-a1.xml" xpointer="d96-a1"/>
